{
 "[h1]M3AT: Maru's 3D Animated Toons[/h1]": "[h1]M3AT: Maru's 3D Animated Toons[/h1]",
 "[i]Animated 3D pawns for [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3819577715]IsoRim Waylith[/url].[/i]": "[i]Анимированные 3D-пешки для [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3819577715]IsoRim Waylith[/url].[/i]",
 "Screenshots use Facial Animation - Retexture, IsoRimZ and Combat Extended (see suggestions).": "На скриншотах: Facial Animation - Retexture, IsoRimZ и Combat Extended (см. рекомендации).",
 "WIP, so expect scuff; letting me know about any issues is appreciated!": "Версия в разработке, возможны шероховатости — сообщайте о проблемах!",
 "[h2]Main Features[/h2]": "[h2]Возможности[/h2]",
 "[*][b]Around 200 Animations[/b] covering most of the game": "[*][b]Около 200 анимаций[/b] почти на всё в игре",
 "[*][b]Apparel models[/b] for everything in the base game, all DLCs and Combat Extended": "[*][b]Модели одежды[/b]: база, все DLC и Combat Extended",
 "[*][b]All hair mods supported[/b] with on-the-fly sprite-to-3D conversion, and hair shows under hats": "[*][b]Все моды причёсок[/b]: спрайты на лету становятся 3D, волосы видны под шапкой",
 "[*][b]Holding and shooting animations adjusted[/b] for every one of IsoRim's 3D weapons, and their sprite-generated slab versions": "[*][b]Хват и стрельба подогнаны[/b] под всё 3D-оружие IsoRim и его плоские версии",
 "[*][b]Holstered weapons[/b] visible (several at once with CE), with draw and holster animations": "[*][b]Оружие в кобурах[/b] (с CE — несколько), с анимацией доставания",
 "[*][b]Body types[/b] for each of RimWorld's, with gender differences and optional variation": "[*][b]Типы телосложения[/b] RimWorld, различия по полу и разнообразие",
 "[*][b]Equipment packs[/b] visible when worn, using IsoRim's models": "[*][b]Снаряжение[/b] видно на пешке (модели IsoRim)",
 "[*][b]Visible Injuries[/b], bandages, scars and missing limbs; wounds match their type, location and severity": "[*][b]Видимые раны[/b], повязки, шрамы и потеря конечностей по типу, месту и тяжести",
 "[*][b]Prosthetics and bionics[/b]: wooden, prosthetic, bionic and archotech limbs and eyes": "[*][b]Протезы[/b]: деревянные, простые, бионические и архотех",
 "[*][b]Gene parts modelled[/b], with tails and ears animated": "[*][b]Части генов[/b]; хвосты и уши анимированы",
 "[*][b]Injury-reactive[/b] idle and movement animations - limping and clutching wounds": "[*][b]Реакция на раны[/b]: хромота, рука на ране",
 "[*][b]Ragdolls[/b] with optional physics flinging": "[*][b]Рэгдоллы[/b] и отбрасывание тел (по желанию)",
 "[*][b]Smooth Growth[/b] from baby to adult, pregnancy shows": "[*][b]Плавный рост[/b] от младенца до взрослого, видна беременность",
 "[*][b]Visible Aging[/b]: wrinkles, stooping, grey hair and more fading in with age": "[*][b]Старение[/b]: морщины, сутулость, седина",
 "[*][b]Size and build sliders[/b] for pawn and head scale": "[*][b]Ползунки[/b] размера пешек и головы",
 "[*][b]Animated faces[/b] powered by [NL] Facial Animation for moods and expressions, with new animated talking": "[*][b]Живые лица[/b] на [NL] Facial Animation, с анимацией речи",
 "[*][b]Full Combat Extended support[/b]": "[*][b]Полная поддержка Combat Extended[/b]",
 "[*][b]Mod weapon support[/b]: IsoRim generates a 3D version from the sprite, M3AT works out where the grips are and adjusts animations to match": "[*][b]Оружие из модов[/b]: IsoRim делает 3D по спрайту, M3AT находит рукоять",
 "[*][b]New camera mode[/b]": "[*][b]Новая камера[/b]",
 "[h2]Freecam mode[/h2]": "[h2]Свободная камера[/h2]",
 "Press [b]F6[/b] in IsoRim's 3D view for a WASD-mouselook freecam, designed for close up play with more detailed pawns. Orders and selections work with the crosshair. The normal pointer comes back when a menu opens, or by pressing Middle mouse (rebindable). Scroll for altitude.": "[b]F6[/b] в 3D-режиме IsoRim — свободная камера (WASD и мышь). Приказы — прицелом, курсор — в меню или средней кнопкой, колесо — высота.",
 "If you don't like the mouselook camera, I recommend turning IsoRim's camera zoom on closest (left) and enabling freelook mode.": "Не нравится обзор мышью? Поставьте «ближайший зум» IsoRim на минимум и включите свободный обзор.",
 "[h2]Performance[/h2]": "[h2]Производительность[/h2]",
 "I've tried to get all models as lightweight as possible without sacrificing looks, and various optimizations have been made to reduce impact.": "",
 "In benchmarks on a 10600KF and 3060, each pawn on screen currently costs about 0.16 ms of frame time (around 1.6 ms for 10 pawns drawn on screen).": "На 10600KF и 3060 каждая пешка на экране стоит около 0,16 мс кадра.",
 "[h2]Requirements[/h2]": "[h2]Требования[/h2]",
 "[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2009463077]Harmony[/url]": "[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2009463077]Harmony[/url]",
 "[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3819577715]IsoRim Waylith[/url]": "[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3819577715]IsoRim Waylith[/url]",
 "[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1635901197][NL] Facial Animation - WIP[/url]": "[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1635901197][NL] Facial Animation - WIP[/url]",
 "[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2581693737][NL] Facial Animation - Experimentals[/url]": "[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2581693737][NL] Facial Animation - Experimentals[/url]",
 "Load M3AT after all of them.": "Загружайте M3AT после них.",
 "[h2]Current Mod Integrations[/h2]": "[h2]Интеграция с модами[/h2]",
 "[*][b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2890901044]Combat Extended[/url][/b]: All apparel modelled, extra holstered weapons show, backpacks work around holsters and equipment, shields are worn and held, reload and hunker animations, and the webbing layer fits over armour.": "[*][b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2890901044]Combat Extended[/url][/b]: вся одежда, оружие в кобурах, рюкзаки и щиты, перезарядка и залегание, разгрузка поверх брони",
 "[*][b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2654432921]Romance on the Rim[/url][/b]: Various animations for the dates": "[*][b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2654432921]Romance on the Rim[/url][/b]: анимации свиданий",
 "[*][b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3823442009][DG]Lovly Animal Cuddling[/url][/b]: 3D cat petting, RimWorld is now playable": "[*][b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3823442009][DG]Lovly Animal Cuddling[/url][/b]: гладить котиков в 3D",
 "[h2]Serving Suggestions[/h2]": "[h2]Рекомендую[/h2]",
 "[*][b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3271240549]Facial Animation - Retexture[/url][/b]: The intended look, used in the screenshots; gives more face variety and a different style to FA": "[*][b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3271240549]Facial Animation - Retexture[/url][/b]: задуманный вид, на скриншотах, больше разных лиц",
 "[*][b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3824503834]IsoRimZ[/url][/b] Adds 3D multistory to IsoRim": "[*][b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3824503834]IsoRimZ[/url][/b]: этажи в 3D",
 "[*][b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2890901044]Combat Extended[/url][/b], [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3831314143]IsoRim Waylith CE Pack[/url][/b], [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2226330302]Pocket Sand[/url][/b] to improve combat and use our multiple holsters": "[*][b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2890901044]Combat Extended[/url][/b], [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3831314143]IsoRim Waylith CE Pack[/url][/b], [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2226330302]Pocket Sand[/url][/b]: бой и кобуры",
 "[*][b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2787342464]Pipette Tool[/url][/b]: Huge QoL tool, great with the freecam": "[*][b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2787342464]Pipette Tool[/url][/b]: очень удобен со свободной камерой",
 "[*]AFU [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2020779666]Women's[/url][/b]/[b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2072106893]Men's[/url][/b] hairstyles, [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2895002564]Gloomy Hair mk2[/url][/b], [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2718021679]Morphs Assorted: Hairs[/url][/b]": "[*]AFU [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2020779666]Women's[/url][/b]/[b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2072106893]Men's[/url][/b] hairstyles, [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2895002564]Gloomy Hair mk2[/url][/b], [b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2718021679]Morphs Assorted: Hairs[/url][/b]",
 "[h2]Compatibility[/h2]": "[h2]Совместимость[/h2]",
 "M3AT is purely visual aside from the optional ragdoll flinging, so it shouldn't have any hard incompatibilities.": "M3AT только меняет вид (кроме отбрасывания тел), серьёзных несовместимостей нет.",
 "For mods that add content:": "Моды с контентом:",
 "[*][b]Hair, beards, weapons[/b]: Supported, see features": "[*][b]Причёски, бороды, оружие[/b]: поддерживаются",
 "[*][b]Clothing mods[/b]: M3AT builds the closest match it can out of existing garments judging by coverage, layer, armour and tech level, in the right colour.": "[*][b]Одежда[/b]: собирается похожая из имеющихся моделей, в нужном цвете",
 "[*][b]Mod races and geneparts[/b]: The weakest area currently, could display unpredictably. Will usually require an IsoRim Patch and Facial Animation patch.": "[*][b]Расы и гены из модов[/b]: слабое место; обычно нужны патчи для IsoRim и Facial Animation",
 "Races with some built in support:": "Расы со встроенной поддержкой:",
 "[*][b]Kiiro[/b]: Faces and hair patched (Requires Kiiro Race Facial Animation and IsoRim Waylith - Kiiro Pack)": "[*][b]Kiiro[/b]: лица и волосы (нужны Kiiro Race Facial Animation и IsoRim Waylith - Kiiro Pack)",
 "[h2]Save game safe[/h2]": "[h2]Безопасно для сохранений[/h2]",
 "M3AT can be added and removed anytime - it's mostly visual.": "M3AT можно добавить и убрать в любой момент.",
 "[h2]Links[/h2]": "[h2]Ссылки[/h2]",
 "[*]discord(.)gg/7t5Aav2f2e Discord: Issues and reports, support, suggestions, and general discussion": "[*]discord(.)gg/7t5Aav2f2e Discord: проблемы, помощь, идеи",
 "[*]github(.)com/MaruMirai/M3AT GitHub: Contribute or raise issues, M3AT is open source": "[*]github(.)com/MaruMirai/M3AT GitHub: открытый исходный код",
 "[*][url=https://github.com/MaruMirai/M3AT/tree/main/M3AT%3A%20Maru%27s%203D%20Animated%20Toons/Docs]Modding guides[/url]: For mod authors adding 3D garments and gene parts, with a Blender add-on (no code needed)": "[*][url=https://github.com/MaruMirai/M3AT/tree/main/M3AT%3A%20Maru%27s%203D%20Animated%20Toons/Docs]Руководства[/url]: 3D-одежда и гены для авторов модов, аддон Blender",
 "To include some helpful info when you have an issue, select a pawn, then open the mod's options and press [b]Copy bug report[/b]. This copies text to your clipboard for use on the Discord or GitHub. It won't send data anywhere.": "Для баг-репорта выберите пешку и нажмите [b]Copy bug report[/b] в настройках мода (текст копируется в буфер, ничего не отправляется).",
 "[h2]Credits[/h2]": "[h2]Благодарности[/h2]",
 "[*][b]Peren717[/b]: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3819577715]IsoRim Waylith[/url], thanks for expanding its API to support M3AT": "[*][b]Peren717[/b]: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3819577715]IsoRim Waylith[/url] и расширение API для M3AT",
 "[*][b]Kndzio[/b]: The original [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3819266222]IsoRim[/url], whose shaders M3AT's are adapted from": "[*][b]Kndzio[/b]: оригинальный [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3819266222]IsoRim[/url], основа шейдеров",
 "[*][b]Nals[/b]: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1635901197]Facial Animation[/url], which our faces run on": "[*][b]Nals[/b]: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1635901197]Facial Animation[/url], на нём работают лица",
 "[*][b]Monymensss[/b] (Sketchfab): The chibi base model, [url=https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/chibi-base-body-96d80b8fd2f542999b11e94ef4ddd9fb]\"Chibi Base Body\"[/url] (CC BY 4.0), rigged and reshaped for M3AT": "[*][b]Monymensss[/b] (Sketchfab): модель [url=https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/chibi-base-body-96d80b8fd2f542999b11e94ef4ddd9fb]\"Chibi Base Body\"[/url] (CC BY 4.0)",
